  d('checkbox-aggregate', 'behaviour', 'The first box is an aggregate with its own rule.', 'A three-state check box cycles unchecked, checked, mixed, and changes nothing else.', 'Choosing "All channels" checks or clears the boxes below it, and they set it to mixed.', 'low', 'deliberate', {'steps': ['checkbox-states#2', 'checkbox-states#3', 'checkbox-states#4', 'checkbox-states#5', 'checkbox-states#10', 'checkbox-states#11', 'checkbox-states#15']}, 'The page documents this: mixed describes an aggregate. A real program does the same by hand.'),
